  "bio": "Gatto is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in intricate lettering styles, bringing each client's vision to life with precision and care at Logan Tattoo Studio in Valenza, Italy. Their work is not only detailed and artistically exceptional, but they also maintain a high standard of cleanliness in their practice, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for all their clients. If you're looking for stunning lettering art inked with utmost professionalism, Gatto is the artist to trust.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Valenza, Piedmont, Italy"
